<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_24__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of this section, “contract of service” includes the collective agreement made under section 14 of the Industrial Relations Act 1967 [Act 177]."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_24__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
