<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_24__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in this section shall be construed as preventing an employer and an employee from agreeing to any rates of the basic wages which are higher than the minimum wages rates as specified in the minimum wages order. Council to review minimum wages order"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
