<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_25__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_25> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
