<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Every meeting of the Council in respect of which minutes of the proceedings have been made in accordance with subsection (2) shall be deemed to have been duly convened and held and all members at the meeting to have been duly qualified to act. Council may invite others to meetings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
