<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council may establish any committee as it considers necessary or expedient to assist it in the performance of its functions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
