<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council shall appoint any of its members to be the chairman of a committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
