<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The members of a committee may be paid such allowances as the Council may determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
