<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The chairman of each committee shall cause minutes of all its meetings to be maintained and kept in proper form and copies of the minutes shall be submitted by the committee to the Council as soon as practicable."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
