<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "A committee may invite any person not being a member of the committee to attend its meetings to advise on any matter under discussion, but that person is not entitled to vote at the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
