<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_32__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If the premises are unoccupied, the enforcement officer shall post a copy of the list of the book of account of wages, register, financial statement or other document seized conspicuously on the premises. Release of the book of account of wages, etc., seized"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
