<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_41> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_41__subsec_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
