<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both. Prosecution"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_55> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
