<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_55> <https://schema.org/text> "No prosecution for an offence under this Act shall be instituted except by or with the written consent of the Public Prosecutor. Compounding of offences"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
