<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "All wages councils established under the repealed Act are dissolved. Savings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
