<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_43> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_43> <https://schema.org/text> "An employer who fails to pay the basic wages as specified in the minimum wages order to his employees commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine of not more than ten thousand ringgit for each employee. Court order"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
