<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_45> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who commits an offence under this Act for which no penalty is expressly provided shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit. Penalty in the case of a continuing offence"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_46> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
