<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_47> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person convicted of an offence under this Act shall, in the case of a repeated offence, be liable to a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@> .
